51
00:03:12,610 --> 00:03:15,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give him back right now!</font>

52
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:18,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I really <i>will</i> knock your lights out!</font>

53
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:21,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't get confused. For a little
