54
00:03:21,990 --> 00:03:25,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you can knock the lights
out of me, General White...</font>

55
00:03:30,430 --> 00:03:32,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...then just you try it!</font>

56
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:34,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! I'm not gonna hold back!</font>

57
00:03:34,670 --> 00:03:36,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get ready to die!</font>

58
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He's really exhausted after</i>
<i>fighting against Buyon...</i></font>

59
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:44,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>That means the odds are</i>
<i>stacked in my favor!</i></font>

60
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:47,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, kid! Come at me already!</font>

61
00:03:47,580 --> 00:03:49,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

62
00:04:04,270 --> 00:04:06,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-Why, you...!</font>

63
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:12,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's all over!</font>

64
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:20,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought a fly had landed on me...</font>

65
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You know, punches...</font>

66
00:04:22,330 --> 00:04:24,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...should be like this!</font>

67
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Got it?</font>

68
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:43,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Who is this kid... ?</i>
<i>He's unbelievably strong...</i></font>

69
00:04:43,350 --> 00:04:46,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>H-He's some sort of monster...</i></font>

70
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:50,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Alright! A Powered Gun!</i></font>

71
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:56,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You still wanna fight?! What's it gonna be?</font>

72
00:04:57,620 --> 00:05:00,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Very well...</font>

73
00:05:00,130 --> 00:05:05,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I give up. I'll hand over the village chief.</font>

74
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:08,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you surrender peacefully?</font>

75
00:05:08,570 --> 00:05:10,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This way.</font>

76
00:05:27,610 --> 00:05:30,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get out, your help's arrived!</font>

77
00:05:30,010 --> 00:05:31,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My help?!</font>

78
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:34,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You don't mean... Honestly?!</font>

79
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:37,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I <i>did</i> hear that it was a child, but...</font>

80
00:05:37,660 --> 00:05:39,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you "Village Chief"?!</font>

81
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:43,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Indeed I am. So you really <i>were</i>
the one who came to save me?</font>

82
00:05:43,970 --> 00:05:47,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Yeah!
--Thank you, thank you!</font>

83
00:05:47,570 --> 00:05:51,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And you're still such a small child...</font>

84
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:54,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And Ha-<i>chan</i> was with me, too.</font>

85
00:05:58,750 --> 00:06:01,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hello...</font>

86
00:06:01,350 --> 00:06:02,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's all okay now!</font>

87
00:06:02,990 --> 00:06:06,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I took care of <i>all</i> of this bad guy's friends!</font>

88
00:06:08,530 --> 00:06:11,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-That's amazing, thank you so much!</font>

89
00:06:11,430 --> 00:06:15,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's alright. Okay, let's hurry back home!</font>

90
00:06:15,170 --> 00:06:17,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, that's right, my outer garments...</font>

91
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:27,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not a move, kid! Don't try anything funny!</font>

92
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:31,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll splatter the village
chief's head like an egg!</font>

93
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-That hurts...!</font>

94
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Damn it! Coward!</font>

95
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:37,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hold it!</font>

96
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:40,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The strength of this Powered
Gun isn't to be taken lightly!</font>

97
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:44,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe I should try it out on something!</font>

98
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:47,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Stop it!
--G-General White!</font>

99
00:06:50,110 --> 00:06:52,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? There's not a
single thing you can do!</font>

100
00:06:52,710 --> 00:06:54,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How do you like <i>this</i> situation?</font>

101
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:03,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit! Doing such cowardly things!</font>

102
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:10,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what do you do now, insolent child?</font>

103
00:07:12,370 --> 00:07:17,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't concern yourself with me,
just hurry and take care of this guy!</font>

104
00:07:19,670 --> 00:07:21,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It doesn't matter if I die!</font>

105
00:07:21,670 --> 00:07:25,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't worry about me! Just take care
of him and bring peace to the village!</font>

106
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:29,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--But...
--Don't worry about me!</font>

107
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:33,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If I can sacrifice myself for the
village, then I will gladly do so!</font>

108
00:07:33,810 --> 00:07:35,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?!</font>

109
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:41,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-lf that's what you want,
I guess I'll do that, but...</font>

110
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:45,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-But...! If at all possible...</font>

111
00:07:45,180 --> 00:07:50,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...I would be very happy
if you saved me, too...</font>

112
00:07:54,290 --> 00:07:58,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--There you have it.
--S-Sorry...</font>

113
00:07:58,290 --> 00:08:02,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well then, how shall I deal with him?</font>

114
00:08:07,030 --> 00:08:08,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">General White!</font>

115
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:13,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please stop doing these bad things!</font>

116
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:16,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

117
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:21,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pretty polite way of
asking you have there...</font>

118
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:24,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...you damn weakling traitor!</font>

119
00:08:24,550 --> 00:08:27,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-But...</font>

120
00:08:27,250 --> 00:08:33,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But hold on a little longer,
I'll take care of you soon enough!</font>

121
00:08:35,260 --> 00:08:43,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">#8, I'll spare the village
chief's life if you do what I say.</font>

122
00:08:43,770 --> 00:08:46,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-Honestly?!</font>

123
00:08:46,010 --> 00:08:47,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yep...</font>

124
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:51,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But only if you destroy <i>him</i>!</font>

125
00:08:52,780 --> 00:08:54,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what'll it be?</font>

126
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:57,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you don't do what I say,
the village chief winds up dead.</font>

127
00:08:57,690 --> 00:08:59,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Will the kid die?</font>

128
00:08:59,350 --> 00:09:01,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Or will the village chief die?</font>

129
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:10,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I cannot do either...</font>

130
00:09:10,730 --> 00:09:12,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I just cannot...!</font>

131
00:09:15,660 --> 00:09:22,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I just cannot...! I just cannot...!</font>

132
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:24,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>...</font>

133
00:09:24,470 --> 00:09:27,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're a poorly made creation
in every sense of the phrase!</font>

134
00:09:27,180 --> 00:09:31,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stand up, #8! Stand up at once! Get up!</font>

135
00:09:31,710 --> 00:09:34,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop it!</font>

136
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i> is really kind-hearted!</font>

137
00:09:37,650 --> 00:09:43,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't let you harass him any more!</font>

138
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:49,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see. In that case, <i>you'll</i> do what I say.</font>

139
00:09:51,730 --> 00:09:54,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Isn't that right?</font>

140
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

141
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:04,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excellent!</font>

142
00:10:04,010 --> 00:10:05,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Face the other way, kid!</font>

143
00:10:05,850 --> 00:10:09,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The other way? What for?</font>

144
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:12,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die!</font>

145
00:10:22,900 --> 00:10:25,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Son Goku!</font>

146
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:33,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Guess not even the kid
can stand up against this!</font>

147
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:35,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku...</font>

148
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Take this! End of the line!</font>

149
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:13,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're in the way!</font>

150
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:16,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You, Artificial Human #8!</font>

151
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:22,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You would fight against me,
General White?!</font>

152
00:11:23,860 --> 00:11:31,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-How dare you do that to Son Goku...!</font>

153
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:35,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is how you would act toward
the ones who gave you life?!</font>

154
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:38,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Die! Die!</font>

155
00:11:40,780 --> 00:11:43,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N-No bullets...!</font>

156
00:11:43,810 --> 00:11:46,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You are a bad person!</font>

157
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:49,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will get rid of you!</font>

158
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:15,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Son Goku, are you okay? Are you dead?!</font>

159
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:19,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's fine. He's alive.</font>

160
00:12:19,700 --> 00:12:23,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just a little done in, though...</font>

161
00:12:24,810 --> 00:12:27,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku!</font>

162
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:31,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But weren't you shot, too,
Ha-<i>chan</i>? Are you okay?!</font>

163
00:12:31,330 --> 00:12:37,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I am an artificial human. Something like
that is nothing to an artificial human!</font>

164
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:40,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So artificial humans are tough!</font>

165
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:56,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks for saving me!</font>

166
00:12:56,420 --> 00:13:01,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It was you who saved me
even more, Son Goku.</font>

167
